POSTGRES_HOST=The name of the postgres host, e.g., postgres (the docker container)
POSTGRES_USER=The user name of the postgres database, e.g., postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=The password of the postgres database user, e.g., some_secure_password9091823+_!
POSTGRES_DB=The name of the database, e.g., sqlzoo

HTTPS=Flag for https usage, e.g., true/false
PROXY_HOST=The proxy host, e.g., myapp.mydomain.com
PROXY_PORT=The port of the proxy, e.g., 8080